    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A truly stunning 4 bedroom semi-detached family home situated in Stamullen, Co. Meath. Arranged over 2 floors, this property has been completed to impressively high standards throughout and has a floor area that extends to c. 133 sq.m (c. 1,432 sq.ft). Providing generously proportioned light filled areas throughout, this beautiful family home has some spectacular features from its wooden floors & tiled finishes to its sleek modern open-plan kitchen. Stamullen is a small rural village with plenty of amenities such as local shops, pub, restaurant, hairdressers and within walking distance of schools & Gormanston College. Gormanston Beach is just a 5 minute drive. It is situated c. 15 minute's drive from Drogheda Town, c.5 minute's drive from the M1 Motorway & only c. 25 minutes to Dublin Airport. Dublin city centre is accessible by both Matthews Coaches and Bus Éireann and the train station can be found within a 5 minute drive. Viewing Is Highly Advised.\n\nAMV 495,000 - For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures\n4 Bedroom Semi-Detached House\nExtends To c. 133 sq.m. (1,432 sq.ft)\nBuilt C. 2020\nAir-To-Water Heating System\nZoned Heating Controls\nMulti Fuel Stove\nPVC Double Glazing Throughout\nPull Down Stair case to Attic Storage\nPartially Floored Attic Space\nOverlooking Small Green Area To Front\nGarden Room (3.85m x 3.70m)\nExternal Electric Socket \nSouth Facing Rear Orientation\nPrivate Rear Aspect\nWooden Garden Pergola\nPaved Patio & Decking Seating Areas\nOff Street Parking Cobble Driveway\nFully Alarmed\n\nAccommodation Includes\nEntrance Hallway\nGuest WC(1.47m x 1.85m)\nLiving Room(3.80m x 4.19m)\nKitchen / Dining(3.86m x 5.91m)\nUtility Room(1.85m x 1.47m)\nLounge(3.27m x 3.11m)\n\n1st Floor \nLanding\nBedroom 1(3.00m x 3.90m)\nEn Suite (1.53m x 2.07m)\nBedroom 2 (2.91m x 4.45m)\nBedroom 3 (2.95m x 2.27m)\nBedroom 4(2.90m x 2.60m)\nMain Bathroom (1.75m x 2.27m)\n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: A2\nBER No. 112997044\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 43.61 kWh/m²/yr\n\nViewing Details\nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\n"
      },
